# Licence

This repository is deliberately licensed so that **anyone can keep this site
alive without asking permission** — including after I am no longer around to
give it. See SUCCESSION.md.

Two licences, split by what the file is.

---

## Content — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

Applies to the writing, project descriptions, case studies, page copy and
images authored by me. In practice: everything under `src/content/`, plus the
prose inside `src/pages/`.

You may copy, redistribute, adapt and build upon this material, for any
purpose, including commercially, provided you give appropriate credit.

Full terms: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Attribution should name Youniss Kandah and, where practical, link to the
original source.

### Not mine to license

Some referenced material is authored by other people and is **not** covered by
the licence above:

- `public/papers/Filomeno_JKU_task6_1.technical_report.pdf` — co-authored with
  G. Filomeno and F. Spiessberger (JKU Linz). Cite it, do not relicense it.
- Third-party logos, screenshots of other people's products, and any quoted
  material remain the property of their respective owners.
- `public/thumbs/*.jpg` are YouTube video thumbnails, kept locally so the pages
  do not hotlink. They are frames of my own videos, but treat them as part of
  the videos rather than as site content.

